This fixture contains data derived from the FOCUS 1.0 Sample Data
(https://github.com/FinOps-Open-Cost-and-Usage-Spec/FOCUS-Sample-Data, FOCUS-1.0/focus_sample_10000.csv),
(c) FinOps Foundation, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
(CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Changes made: the cost columns (BilledCost, EffectiveCost, ListCost, ContractedCost) are multiplied by 100;
all dates are shifted by a whole number of days so the data ends yesterday, and the billing periods are
recomputed as calendar months; yesterday's cost for "Amazon Virtual Private Cloud" is set to three times its
average of the seven days before. Numeric columns stored as text in the CSV are cast to numbers. The result is
synthetic and is not the FinOps Foundation's data or an endorsement by it.
